  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Oh, right, now I remember!”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Entropist 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A number of times per day equal to your Constitution modifier, you can temporarily fill a wild talent slot that’s been left open, gaining access to a utility wild talent or infusion you know up to the level of the chosen slot for 1 minute. You can only spontaneously gain one wild talent at a time. This cannot be used to fill slots to which you don’t have access (such as by having too low a Constitution score or having used the bend fate class feature). This is a free action, but can only be performed once per minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
